{'symbol': 'SNPS', 'date': '2022-09-20 09:05:00', 'title': "SYNOPSYS UNVEILS INDUSTRY'S FIRST UNIFIED EMULATION AND PROTOTYPING SYSTEM ADDRESSING VERIFICATION REQUIREMENTS ACROSS THE CHIP DEVELOPMENT CYCLE", 'text': "UNIFIED HARDWARE PROVIDES FLEXIBLE CAPACITY WITH FASTER COMPILE FOR HARDWARE VERIFICATION AND SUPERIOR PERFORMANCE FOR SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF. , SEPT. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DELIVERING NEW LEVELS OF PERFORMANCE AND FLEXIBILITY FOR SOC VERIFICATION AND EARLY SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT, SYNOPSYS, INC. (NASDAQ:\xa0SNPS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE INDUSTRY'S FIRST UNIFIED HARDWARE SYSTEM FOR EMULATION AND PROTOTYPING BASED ON THE SYNOPSYS ZEBU® EP1 EMULATION SYSTEM."}